<title>CROATIA: CROATIA JUNE TOURISM RISES.</title>
<headline>CROATIA JUNE TOURISM RISES.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State Bureau of Statistics issued the following tourism figures.</p>
<p>				 JUNE	  MAY     JAN-JUNE</p>
<p>    Total tourists	595,563    405,765   1,560,582</p>
<p>    Change y/y (pct)     +122	  +52	  +126</p>
<p>    -Croatian	     149,653    132,277     567,642</p>
<p>    -Foreign		445,910    273,488     992,940</p>
<p>    Overnights	  2,945,650  1,523,721   6,112,301</p>
<p>    Change y/y (pct)     +135	  +66	  +138</p>
<p>-- Zagreb newsroom +385 1 455 7075</p>
